  _body: "The Setting: Damietta (El Lissan)\u2014a coastal city powered by fishing,
    timber, and boatbuilding.\n\nThe Journey: Experience life as a Dumyati teen coming
    of age.\n\nThe Goal: Master local crafts to help your father achieve his lifelong
    dream."
